Pattern 3: Fast + Slow — Linked List

Here fast moves 2 steps, slow moves 1 step.

slow → 
fast → →
Template
ListNode slow = head;
ListNode fast = head;

while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {

    slow = slow.next;
    fast = fast.next.next;
}
Common problems
Middle of Linked List — LeetCode 876
Linked List Cycle — LeetCode 141
Linked List Cycle II — LeetCode 142
Palindrome Linked List — LeetCode 234
🧠 Remember

Linked List + middle/cycle → Slow + Fast.

And:

slow = 1 step
fast = 2 steps
