Pattern 5: Two Pointer + Sorting

This is very important for 3Sum / 4Sum.

First:

Arrays.sort(nums);

Then fix one element and use two pointers.

Example: 3Sum
        i
        ↓
[-4, -1, -1, 0, 1, 2]
       ↑        ↑
      left     right
Common problems
3Sum — LeetCode 15
4Sum — LeetCode 18
3Sum Closest — LeetCode 16
3Sum Smaller — LeetCode 259
🧠 Remember

3Sum/4Sum → Sort first → Fix one/two → Two Pointer.

For 3Sum:

i fixed
left = i + 1
right = n - 1

Then:

sum < 0 → left++
sum > 0 → right--
sum == 0 → answer
