Pattern 6: Partition / Dutch National Flag

Used when you need to divide an array into sections.

Classic example:

Sort Colors

0s | 1s | unknown | 2s

Uses three pointers:

low
mid
high
Problem
Sort Colors — LeetCode 75

Template idea
int low = 0;
int mid = 0;
int high = nums.length - 1;

while (mid <= high) {

    if (nums[mid] == 0) {
        swap(nums, low, mid);
        low++;
        mid++;
    }
    else if (nums[mid] == 1) {
        mid++;
    }
    else {
        swap(nums, mid, high);
        high--;
    }
}
🧠 Remember
0 → left
1 → middle
2 → right

This is a three-pointer partition pattern.
