Pattern 9: Two Pointer + Greedy

Here pointer movement is based on a greedy decision.

Classic:

Container With Most Water
left                    right
 ↓                        ↓
[1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7]

Area:

min(height[left], height[right])
×
(right - left)

Move the shorter side.

if height[left] < height[right]
    left++
else
    right--

Problem:

Container With Most Water — LeetCode 11

🧠 Remember

When two boundaries limit the answer, ask: which pointer can safely move?
