Pattern 10: Two Pointer + Math / Optimization

A good example is:

Trapping Rain Water

LeetCode 42

You maintain:

left
right
leftMax
rightMax

Concept:

leftMax < rightMax
→ process left

otherwise
→ process right
🧠 Remember

Two ends + maintaining maximum boundary → consider Two Pointer.

🧠 MOST IMPORTANT RECOGNITION CHEAT SHEET

When you see a problem, ask this:

Question clue	Think
Sorted array + pair	Left + Right
Compare first & last	Left + Right
Palindrome	Left + Right
Remove elements	Slow + Fast
Remove duplicates	Slow + Fast
Move zeroes	Slow + Fast
Linked List middle	Slow + Fast
Linked List cycle	Slow + Fast
Subarray/substring longest	Sliding Window
Subarray/substring minimum	Sliding Window
3Sum	Sort + Two Pointer
4Sum	Sort + Two Pointer